1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,192
A tiny gap in a railway

2
00:00:01,192 --> 00:00:02,851
can look like a mistake.

3
00:00:02,851 --> 00:00:04,458
But removing it can destroy the

4
00:00:04,458 --> 00:00:05,442
whole line.

5
00:00:05,742 --> 00:00:07,983
Maya left space between the rails.

6
00:00:07,983 --> 00:00:09,744
The owner wanted a smoother ride,

7
00:00:09,744 --> 00:00:11,238
with no gaps at all.

8
00:00:11,538 --> 00:00:13,375
Across the canyon, a rival joined

9
00:00:13,375 --> 00:00:14,877
every rail tightly.

10
00:00:14,877 --> 00:00:16,714
His train rolled quietly past the

11
00:00:16,714 --> 00:00:17,605
station.

12
00:00:17,905 --> 00:00:19,445
Then summer arrived.

13
00:00:19,445 --> 00:00:20,875
Hot steel expands.

14
00:00:20,875 --> 00:00:22,746
Those little spaces gave each rail

15
00:00:22,746 --> 00:00:23,901
room to grow.

16
00:00:24,201 --> 00:00:25,830
The rival rails had nowhere to

17
00:00:25,830 --> 00:00:26,427
go.

18
00:00:26,427 --> 00:00:28,436
They pushed against each other, until

19
00:00:28,436 --> 00:00:30,173
the track bent sideways.

20
00:00:30,473 --> 00:00:32,837
Maya watched her train cross safely.

21
00:00:32,837 --> 00:00:34,879
What looked imperfect was exactly what

22
00:00:34,879 --> 00:00:36,490
made her railway work.
